OL,3,GNEWSAPeople are investing in inner-city
OL,4,Apubs, but can they succeed?
OL,5,
OL,6,FJenna Morris is determined to keep her
OL,7,F200-year-old inner-city pub alive.
OL,9,FHer husband bought the Spring Bank
OL,10,FTavern on the edge of Hull city centre
OL,11,F14 years ago when it was, she says,
OL,12,F"pretty much derelict".
OL,14,FFor the past five years it has hosted a
OL,15,Frock venue run by a tenant, but now
OL,16,FMorris has taken it over and is leading
OL,17,Fa refurbishment costing about #50,000.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
