OL,3,GNEWSAPeople are investing in inner-city
OL,4,Apubs, but can they succeed?
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe is one of three owners who told the
OL,7,FBBC they were investing in traditional
OL,8,Fpubs in a part of Hull where many
OL,9,Fothers have fallen by the wayside over
OL,10,Fthe past few decades.
